        "note": "仅 AutoDream 的procedural refinement可纳：它根据带原文引用的session outcome创建、编辑或删除可复用skill，改变actor可用的操作指令。语义记录与图索引合并本身不算Harness演化。 逐项证据、分歧与纠正保留于 docs/internal/reports/maintenance-2026-11-11/。不声称复算全部论文数字。",
        "owner_login": "adongwanai",
        "promote_to_repo": false,
        "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T07:29:09.486852+00:00",
        "reviewed_on": "2026-11-12",
        "source_hash": "a5c08eda7ada5d89c495570dc4805dfa3e43e9de83cc1c3bc06fb6e3f8865bc9",
        "summary_override": {
          "summary_en": "The procedural-skill branch of MIRIX AutoDream judges session outcomes from execution transcripts, then uses a curator to create, edit, or delete skill instructions for later agents. Skills acquired on training tasks are frozen and evaluated for reuse on new tasks. Inclusion rests on feedback-driven revision of procedural steps, separate from semantic-record consolidation and factual retrieval. The experiments evaluate the combined process, without isolating the benefit of every skill edit or individual component.",
          "summary_zh": "MIRIX 的 AutoDream 程序性技能分支根据会话轨迹判断成败，再由 curator 创建、编辑或删除供后续 Agent 使用的技能指令。训练任务形成的技能库冻结后，在新任务上评估复用。纳入依据是反馈驱动的程序性步骤修订，语义记录合并与事实检索不属于这条证据；实验评估的是整套流程，未单独证明每次技能修改或某个组件的收益。"
        },
